{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261013/photo/bkn-20261013133259945-1013_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261013140642\"/><p>現場冒出大量濃煙。</p><p>屯門發生火警。今午(13日)1時27分，多名市民報案，指海華路11號屯門公眾貨物裝卸區有濃煙冒出，懷疑有金屬廢料起火。救援人員接報到場灌救，起火原因有待調查。據東網讀者提供圖片可見，大量濃煙席捲半空，並伴隨陣陣燒膠味。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T06:20:43.527429+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T05:32:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T06:17:46.904543+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:17:46.904543+00:00","content_hash":"5508c242aef2ab12785edf02de9b79e33b24d7e4715108e77c19b2207a03e30b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}